{"game": "drg-rogue-core", "language": "english", "appid": 2605790, "month": "2026-07", "window": 1, "start_date": 1782864000, "end_date": 1783555199, "month_true_total": 393, "quota": 16, "returned": 16, "pulled_at": "2026-09-02 11:06:37 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "229983172", "author": {"steamid": "76561199811214980", "personaname": "CedRocks8", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199811214980/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 1524, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 415, "last_played": 1784213311, "avatar": "cf152947b7460fff5d9c82342fbccc67ac7be1fc"}, "language": "english", "review": "GOOD GAME\r\n", "timestamp_created": 1783554434, "timestamp_updated": 1783554434, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1779292819", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229978306", "author": {"steamid": "76561199761122988", "personaname": "Abraham Kadabraham", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/flubby_joe/", "num_games_owned": 57, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 448, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 384, "last_played": 1783658241, "avatar": "6bc69199069e9ba007b0ca768bfb3fdf7d219fe9"}, "language": "english", "review": "ROCK AND STONE", "timestamp_created": 1783549869, "timestamp_updated": 1783549869, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.463917523622512817", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1779292819", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229977314", "author": {"steamid": "76561199465918671", "personaname": "Venomblitz", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199465918671/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 4082, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 340, "playtime_at_review": 3433, "last_played": 1788306519, "avatar": "e8cce4991c9e1d5b76213328f40bc9c78ee542ed"}, "language": "english", "review": "Roguelikes are my favorite game genres and the team adapted well that genre to the classic that is Deep Rock Galactic.", "timestamp_created": 1783548915, "timestamp_updated": 1783548915, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1779292819", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229967213", "author": {"steamid": "76561197994646575", "personaname": "SRes", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197994646575/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 111, "playtime_forever": 4321, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3733, "last_played": 1785416954, "avatar": "d0802aaf0329446c17a7a98590c88d6b4c9532f8"}, "language": "english", "review": "Patch RC: EA: 01.02 broke the game.\n\nNo one bothered to actually playtest their patch. Bosses are almost unkillable, they \"counter-attack\" (new mechanic in this patch!) you automatically, one shotting you, Molaktula is the main offender. Their first big patch was a great one, but they decided to absolutely decimate the game with a \"hotfix\".\nRamok on Level 6 one shotted me with full armor and full HP, and that's on Depth 3, not the max difficulty even. On previous patches it dealt 4 times less damage at least.\n\nOr the game is just bugged and random one shots are due to vibe coding. Boss and minion damage is not consistent run to run.", "timestamp_created": 1783540193, "timestamp_updated": 1783622707, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.472440958023071289", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1779292819", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229964503", "author": {"steamid": "76561198333798549", "personaname": "Paleo Jake", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198333798549/", "num_games_owned": 276, "num_reviews": 150, "playtime_forever": 985, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 174, "last_played": 1784180515, "avatar": "31db89415e0be141b8397f7d9451939b5d7fef84"}, "language": "english", "review": "ROCK AND STONE!", "timestamp_created": 1783538058, "timestamp_updated": 1783538058, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.463917523622512817", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1779292819", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229961832", "author": {"steamid": "76561198213019268", "personaname": "Stormrphosis", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Stormrphosis/", "num_games_owned": 280, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 889, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 889, "last_played": 1779833033, "avatar": "8fc16b28bc7f61be4d803670e647938039b51ee5"}, "language": "english", "review": "Game was fun, but sadly they are so deaf to how this game is running atm, everything being copied from the previous game with nothing new being added and if anything breaking it more when they use their other game as this base while \"fixing game bugs\" making the game just even worse.\n\nA shame it was a fun game but now its ♥♥♥♥.", "timestamp_created": 1783536136, "timestamp_updated": 1783536136, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.46804124116897583", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1779292819", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229958705", "author": {"steamid": "76561198064110544", "personaname": "𝔾𝕦𝕣þ", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/BleddAnus/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 2790, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 807, "playtime_at_review": 1306, "last_played": 1788318025, "avatar": "b7066fb6ff81e0241bea7620e0bda9e06b669c13"}, "language": "english", "review": "literally, as per the last game, locked into a deep dive everytime... \r\n", "timestamp_created": 1783533680, "timestamp_updated": 1783533680, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.477448016405105591", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1779292819", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229951739", "author": {"steamid": "76561198313517179", "personaname": "cheddar_attack", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/cheddar_attack/", "num_games_owned": 251, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 3490, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 98, "playtime_at_review": 3018, "deck_playtime_at_review": 172, "last_played": 1788362402, "avatar": "75742adcf6eb145dab6b31f6e45d0879f6eeec35"}, "language": "english", "review": "I just hit 50 hours in Deep Rock Galactic: Rogue Core (the majority of it being on the highest difficulty) and I have really enjoyed it so far! I have over 800 hours in Deep Rock Galactic and I think that Rogue Core is a really fun spinoff. Even though it's in early access so there's still lots to be added, it's very fun in its current state. Rogue Core is tougher and requires more cooperation with teammates than DRG, but you are still rewarded when you lose, so it's fun even if you don't win a run. All of the dwarves are fun to play, and runs feel different with random weapons, grenades, equipment, upgrades, bio boosters, etc. It's really fun when your build all falls into place after you get enough upgrades, and skilled players will be able to win most of the time even if they don't get upgrades that benefit them much. There were some issues that some people had with the gameplay on release, but most of them have been changed/fixed after update 01 and the gameplay loop is even better since than.\nThere are currently some performance issues that make Rogue Core run worse than Deep Rock Galactic, though I'm sure over time the performance will get better as early access proceeds given Ghost Ship Games' track record with DRG (which is a pretty well optimized game). Overall, if you like DRG, you'll probably like Rogue Core, and if you're on the fence, you can always wait until later in development for it to be more polished, but I personally would recommend it :)", "timestamp_created": 1783528192, "timestamp_updated": 1783528192, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1779292819", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229951269", "author": {"steamid": "76561198911119215", "personaname": "Autistic Penquin", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/AutisticPenquin/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 685, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 436, "last_played": 1784763734, "avatar": "9fbf1c42a938fcb3c02ee0b3ca86d3d3ae8d5c26"}, "language": "english", "review": "TLDR: lil' bit difficult, but a fun game to play (terrain glitches sometimes, but not often)\n\nThought it was too hard, found out i was playing on hard mode -_- Good game!\n\ndisregard what i said earlier, I'm just ass at this game lol. if you're curious, i said there was too high of a difficulty spike, and that the terrain could be buggy. While yes, the terrain part is still true, i do have to give some slack (it is early access, after all). There is a considerable jump in difficulty from Depth 01 - 02, but you can just select \"D-01\" to train a bit before going to the harder levels. I did not know this at first, hence the \"too hard\" claim. (I'm a lil doopid)\n\nHonestly, I love the changes to the game. It's still DRG, but it's unique enough to be it's own thing! I love how, instead of spending 69,420 hours to pick berries n sh** to unlock beers, you just work out instead. On that note, I love the workout system. It's simple and challenging (or I'm just bad), and it isn't just there for no reason.\n\nOverall, I love this game so far, and I'm exited to see where Ghost Ship will take it from here! (assuming I use my \"brian\", whatever THAT is...)", "timestamp_created": 1783527835, "timestamp_updated": 1783545830, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1779292819", "hardware": {"system_ram": "15525", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen AI 5 340 w/ Radeon 840M              ", "adapter_description": "AMD Radeon(TM)  840M Graphics", "vram_size": 460}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229948243", "author": {"steamid": "76561199875159752", "personaname": "Manaphy454", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199875159752/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 3329, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1263, "playtime_at_review": 250, "last_played": 1788362668, "avatar": "dda48c99908524f40b846d9f3a6f694c57b321bd"}, "language": "english", "review": "complicated but fun", "timestamp_created": 1783525512, "timestamp_updated": 1783525512, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1779292819", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229927774", "author": {"steamid": "76561198068115124", "personaname": "Cobra", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/paulaocdm111/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 125, "playtime_forever": 2088, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1805, "last_played": 1783752096, "avatar": "969452dc8c2635a8e9cd6f2fa69cb464feafa526"}, "language": "english", "review": "Excellent!", "timestamp_created": 1783508157, "timestamp_updated": 1783508157, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1779292819", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229921578", "author": {"steamid": "76561198005954768", "personaname": "YYYYY", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198005954768/", "num_games_owned": 555, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 8128, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6071, "last_played": 1785331065, "avatar": "79d3fe5839617eb83a9661071ed021dd56ac8a5b"}, "language": "english", "review": "First off, game was reviewed in Early Access.\r\n\r\nEarly Access doesn't meant perfect. In fact game has lots of bugs. I get DCs, Jumble ♥♥♥♥♥ my builds, puts a useless irreplaceable minigun as grenade and so, so many bugs. If this is disqualifier for you? Don't buy it now, wait and see.\r\n\r\nThat said, it went from a very frustrating shooter experience to a very crazy, very fun rogue like co-op and I suspect the team will listen and make it even better.", "timestamp_created": 1783501181, "timestamp_updated": 1783501181, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.51754385232925415", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1779292819", "hardware": {"system_ram": "65456", "os": "Windows 10", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 9 5900X 12-Core Processor            ", "adapter_description": "AMD Radeon RX 6900 XT", "vram_size": 16337}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229917941", "author": {"steamid": "76561198757662732", "personaname": "j.goelz2003", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198757662732/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 6024, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1035, "playtime_at_review": 673, "last_played": 1788319083, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "just deep rock galactic but moar gun, moar fun\n(ps: i have 11gigs of DD4 ram, if it runs butter smooth on ultra graphics for me it'll run for you just fine)", "timestamp_created": 1783496553, "timestamp_updated": 1783496763, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.48245614767074585", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1779292819", "hardware": {"system_ram": "7519", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 5 5600G with Radeon Graphics         ", "adapter_description": "Radeon RX 5500", "vram_size": 4054}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229908294", "author": {"steamid": "76561199177557874", "personaname": "XeviousBread", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199177557874/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 47, "playtime_forever": 4675, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 295, "last_played": 1787099682, "avatar": "343b2f0a1c54509a55985804b5e18e4ce564ab62"}, "language": "english", "review": "As a vet from Space Rig 17 (890 hours before trying RC) there's a lot to appreciate about this game. Great variety of abilities, enemies, and events to interact with. I can feel the early access in little things here and there, and Omega doesn't quite hit like Mission Control, but I really like it so far.", "timestamp_created": 1783484227, "timestamp_updated": 1783484227, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1779292819", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229906757", "author": {"steamid": "76561198069062762", "personaname": "approachretreat", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198069062762/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 6815, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 203, "playtime_at_review": 6439, "last_played": 1787801309, "avatar": "4f7aada7f6c83fb1cd5ffca9550afe1270055d13"}, "language": "english", "review": "Yay fun", "timestamp_created": 1783482342, "timestamp_updated": 1783482342, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1779292819", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "229902448", "author": {"steamid": "76561199520878002", "personaname": "Gumpers08", "